Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikyuu wo sukuu shimei o obite tatakau otoko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.92,0:01:38.08,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Deploy the main wings !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:40.60,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Main wing power offline !\N Unable to deploy !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.78,0:01:42.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,8,000 till Gatlantis !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:45.82,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Chief Engineer !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.82,0:01:46.98,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,No response from the engine !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.43,0:01:51.48,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Urgent message from the Antares !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:56.88,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,"We're right behind the Yamato, but can't stay much\N longer because we're approaching the critical escape line."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:59.80,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,"Leave the ship by any means possible !"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.94,0:02:06.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Okita...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:09.00,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}...sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:12.90,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,All hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:15.12,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Abandon ship !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:20.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,The ship is being pulled into the enemy's\N gravitational field due to engine failure !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.60,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{kakuhan}All departments, follow evacuation protocols !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:29.36,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{sumiyaka}Leave the ship immediately and get to the Antares !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:34.48,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:36.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Shima...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:39.36,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,No, I want to stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.50,0:02:40.78,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,No objections !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:44.98,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Shima...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:51.34,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Everyone feels the same,\N including Captain Hijikata...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:58.74,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,But if we don't leave, the other \Ncrew members will hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:02.23,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.23,0:03:05.30,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,That's a team leader's responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:08.50,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Mr. Tokugawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:20.73,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Critical escape line approaching.\N Remaining time for escape, 6-0-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.20,0:03:23.28,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,First Officer Sanada take starboard !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:25.33,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Chief Tactical Officer Kodai take port !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:27.28,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Lead the crew evacuation !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:28.14,def2,BOTH,0,0,0,,Aye, sir !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.74,0:03:33.06,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Chief Engineer Tokugawa, follow protocol and lock down the wave motion engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:34.28,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:42.86,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Cosmo Tigers and all remaining ships on board, take what \Npersonnel you can, leave the ship, and head for the Antares !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:54.96,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,All hands, evacuate quickly !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.34,0:03:56.38,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{tamerauna}Don't hesitate !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.72,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{tamerauna}Do your best to survive !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:02.28,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{tatakai}The war has just begun !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:07.06,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{tatakai}Each of you must live to \Nsupport the future of Earth !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:15.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Kato !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.00,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Keyman !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:26.14,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:27.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Don't say that !\NCome on, stand up !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.08,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Hurry !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:31.86,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Help me, please !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.04,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Hurry !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:46.98,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Auxiliary power is below 10%.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:49.72,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Losing ship interior gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:53.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,First Officer Sanada !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.40,0:05:00.58,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Reaching the critical escape line. \NOn board craft no longer have enough power to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:04.63,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Antares, this is Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:06.92,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Crew evacuation is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:11.02,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Turn around immediately, and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:15.50,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:25.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Antares has recovered all ships\N from the Yamato and is escaping !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:40.00,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Yamato is falling toward the interior of the Comet Empire and we've lost communication !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:43.28,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Yamato, I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.28,0:05:45.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,High dimensional energy signatures \Ncoming from the Comet Empire !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.06,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Missiles !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:50.08,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Come about 180 degrees and break away at once !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:03.90,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:13.72,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,A massive wave motion shield...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.53,0:06:16.56,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Could that be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:21.48,Karaoke Translation op,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\move(954,608,962,1042,1,4463)}Ginga
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.93,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,I won't let you get through...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.53,0:06:33.62,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,...Gatlantis !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:42.88,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,On behalf of the almighty Emperor Zorder,\N I deliver this message to the leader of Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:47.96,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,I confirm receipt of Earth's response.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.78,0:07:03.28,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,I admire your determination to fight until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:07.80,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,I will put up a worthy fight, but before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.62,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,...allow me to send you a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:22.72,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,I've heard a number of children are suffering from a \Nterminal illness as a result of the war against Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:27.63,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,{sono}I'm sending you data for medicine that can cure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:33.86,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,By using it, you should be able to\N save those who have this fatal illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:42.06,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,I present it to you as a reward\Nfor a certain Earth soldier's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:47.14,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Commander couldn't evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:51.04,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Same for Nagakura...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.04,0:07:54.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,...Kodai, Operations Chief Mori, and even the Gamie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:01.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:04.82,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Let me die !\N Please let me die !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:11.08,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,First Lieutenant Kato says\N he'll accept any punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:11.84,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I beg you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:13.06,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:16.08,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}The public must not know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:20.30,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{wagako}...that a warrior of the Yamato betrayed his ship,\N even if it was because of his love for his child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.30,0:08:24.23,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Keep tight-lipped about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:29.76,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}If he wants to atone for his sins,\N he can die in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:43.48,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\pos(930,134)}MAIN SHAFT Elevator
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.40,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,Sir, are you alright ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:51.26,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I'm fine, but the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:08:58.43,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It's similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:00.60,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It's a Yamato-class after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:06.00,def2,AI,0,0,0,,Route to the mission area determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:09.68,def2,YURIA,0,0,0,,First Officer Kanzaki, here's the\N route from the Command A.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:11.78,def2,KANZAKI,0,0,0,,Approved and shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:13.78,def2,HOSHINA,0,0,0,,Everything goes like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:19.53,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,The Ginga is a prototype for the next generation of ships that \Nare potentially capable of A.I. equipped autonomous operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.53,0:09:24.78,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,The future is extreme.\N It's nothing but efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:29.92,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,All humans have to do is \N approve the A.I.'s decisions, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:32.80,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,That's inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.52,0:09:39.34,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Welcome aboard the Federation Space Cruiser Ginga.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:42.10,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,I'm the captain, Todo Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:45.38,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,First and foremost, please come\N to the central operations room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:56.84,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,As you know, the Garmillas shield is capable of preventing warp by nullifying Gatlantis's dimensional jump ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:10:04.90,def2,URARA,0,0,0,,Our primary mission is to protect the Garmillas shield, but the second wave of the attack will be a problem.{come problematic.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.90,0:10:09.48,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,There are many vessels with\N dual annihilation missiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:13.66,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,If the shield is breached, \NEarth will be in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:18.86,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,So, I proposed a surprise attack\N with a small group of elite soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.70,0:10:23.78,def2,URARA,0,0,0,,Using the Ginga's wave motion shield, \Nwe will attack the enemy vanguard...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:27.18,def2,URARA,0,0,0,,...and destroy it before they \Ncan regroup with the main force.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:30.70,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,To perfect the plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.18,0:10:37.24,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,...the next generation A.I. is undergoing a continuous self-growth simulation in the Time Fault...{the next generation A.I.'s self-growth\N simulation is ongoing in the Time Fault...}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:41.12,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{tsuneni}...simultaneously improving the \NGinga's A.I. with the latest data.{constantly updating the Ginga's A.I. with the latest data.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:47.84,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Even so, it'll take time to \Nsurpass human experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:55.52,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,So, I'd like the Yamato crew to provide your \Nknowledge and experience to improve the Ginga's A.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:58.54,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Copy our knowledge ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:05.66,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,You'll be assigned to the primary and secondary bridges, and all your actions will be recorded.{traced.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:09.44,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,I have approval from HQ, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:13.88,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,It's essential to the success of Plan G.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:16.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Plan G ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:19.88,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,The Yamato was lost.{has sunk.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.68,0:11:26.58,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,In order for mankind to survive, \Nwe've transferred the Yamato's DNA to this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:35.70,def2,AI,0,0,0,,I propose activation of CRS.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.24,0:11:36.98,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.58,0:11:39.38,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Ginga, maximum combat speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:47.18,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,Enemy fleet is in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:49.98,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,CRS efficiency, 80%.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:54.04,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,Wave motion energy injected. Initiating boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:04.84,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,All ships, wave motion\N core resonance confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:09.76,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,Wave motion shield output has\N exceeded 750,000 TPa and rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:13.78,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,I didn't know the Cosmo Reverse\N System was capable of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:17.50,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,The heart of this ship came from the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:25.82,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,It doesn't have the ability to restore a planet, but it's an ideal device for controlling wave motion energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.94,0:12:29.68,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,A wave motion gun isn't equipped, is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:31.88,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,The Cosmo Reverse rejects it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:39.34,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,Not just the wave motion gun, but our conventional weapons malfunction if we try to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:46.08,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,{genin}The cause is unknown, so we have to rely on our escort fleet for all combat, including self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:47.76,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That's how it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:52.36,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I designed the Ginga for exploration.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:57.08,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Even so, we have to use it this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.32,0:13:17.33,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,Wave motion shield is \Nweakening at a rate of 8,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:21.30,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,We should move forward and\N enter the escort fleet's firing range.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:26.20,def2,AI,0,0,0,,Bombardment is ineffective\N with our current firepower.{war strength.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:30.08,def2,AI,0,0,0,,Suggest Operation Black Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:36.58,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:39.86,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Black Bird...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:45.04,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Unmanned craft are already...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:14:01.72,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,Each Black Bird is equipped with bombs made from a mass-produced wave motion core.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:08.92,def2,Deploy,0,0,0,,We'll deploy them to the center of the enemy fleet, then amplify them with the Ginga's Cosmo Reverse causing an overload.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:15.66,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The resulting wave motion resonance \Nwill disable the enemy fleet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:20.10,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,The Yamato used the same\N strategy at the 11th Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:26.43,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,But even with the latest A.I., how do we\N get to the center of the enemy fleet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:34.82,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,Correct. A skilled pilot \Nvolunteered to lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:37.42,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Don't tell me, it's Kato...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:43.23,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,That's suicide !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:47.58,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,He'll be attacked from all directions\N once he leaves the warp interference area !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.70,0:15:25.88,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,We'll hold the enemy advancement \Nfor 10 days at our current combat strength.{with the current war strength.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:33.86,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{sonokan}During that time, 100 days will pass in the Time Fault, \Nallowing us to finish several dozen wave motion ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:43.08,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{sorewo}We'll hold for another 10 days by deploying the new ships, then again and again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:54.64,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{korewo}If we repeat this, it won't matter\N how strong our enemy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:55.83,def2,What,0,0,0,,What about the people ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.68,def2,What,0,0,0,,The crew won't be able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:01.18,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,We're very close to\N building an unmanned fleet...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.18,0:16:05.10,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,...and the Ginga and the Black Birds prove that.{are the proof of it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:12.76,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,The creation of artificial human soldiers is becoming \Nreal thanks to the data sampled from Gatlantian soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:14.98,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,100 days...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:17.86,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,...if we can just hold for 100 days...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:27.83,def2,YURIA,0,0,0,,The wave motion cores are getting \Nshot down, and decreasing in number !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:30.98,def2,AI,0,0,0,,Emergency proposal, \Nstart the resonance immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:38.58,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Withdraw the Black Bird squadron !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:40.38,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Black Bird squadron, retreat immediately !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:41.68,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Kato !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:44.34,def2,AI,0,0,0,,Begin resonance ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:45.98,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:49.98,def2,YURIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(950,586)}Ginga
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:48.24,def2,YURIA,0,0,0,,Wave motion energy injected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:53.64,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:56.18,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,You can't win a war with sanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.53,0:18:05.00,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Eliminate unnecessary items and\N make use of anything useful...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:07.64,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,...for effective and swift victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:11.36,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That's Plan G, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:14.90,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,No, Plan G is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:18.38,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,Are you alright with this, Captain Todo ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:26.34,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,Given your mother's circumstances,\N I understand how you feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:29.34,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,...but deep down, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:30.52,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:35.38,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do \Nwith my father or mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:38.26,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,It's none of your business, Kaoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:45.28,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,The weak will perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:49.98,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,We learned that the hard way \Nduring the war against Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:55.40,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{naniwo}No matter what I lose, I must...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:01.32,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.08,0:19:07.66,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Why won't you let me die ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:31.78,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:36.08,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Nothing.\N I thought I heard someone crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.08,0:19:37.68,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Must be the sound of the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:39.98,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:47.08,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,This is Keyman.\N The fog is getting thicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:48.98,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Can you see anything from up there ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:49.88,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:55.53,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}We'll circle around a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:59.66,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}You go back to the ship. \NIt's dangerous to fly in this fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:00.58,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:16.94,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Where are we ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:20.64,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be\N inside the White Comet, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:26.78,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,But I don't think a Gatlantis base could \Noperate on an empty planet like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:33.92,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Maybe we were tossed onto a planet\N several thousand light years away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:41.14,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Layers of limited information\N can mess with your perception.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:51.10,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Hey, you jerk...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.03,0:21:17.30,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Of all places...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:22.14,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Could it be Teresa's guidance ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.72,0:21:28.18,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,That planet is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:31.92,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,If it responds to the blood of the Zemurian...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:37.64,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I know, but those lives have no future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:39.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Who's there ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:42.42,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:51.70,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:54.18,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,How ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.72,0:22:00.68,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:06.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.23,0:22:11.56,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:14.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You should stay in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:17.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I'll call Dr. Sado...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:17.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Who...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.24,0:22:23.18,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.78,0:22:44.93,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 19
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.78,0:22:44.93,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(448,1044)}Yamato's Successor Bears the Name of Ginga
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:18.48,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Cottony clouds drift high across the sky\N{\i1}Sora takaku nagareru kieyuku wata no kumo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:31.24,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Holding out both hands, I stretch out in the falling leaves\N{\i1}Ryoote wo age ah senobi shita rakuyou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.51,0:23:51.54,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}As the house lights come on, I wish to meet people smiling at each other\N{\i1}Akari tomoru mado waraiau hito ni aitai to omou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:24:05.67,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Believing in a miraculous enounter{meeting} to become real, I shout out for love\N{\i1}Sou kanau hazusa kiseki no deai ni ai sakenda
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.65,0:24:25.63,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Luminous lives meet and bond with each other\N{\i1}Kagayaku jinsei no meguriawase tsumuideyuku
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.63,0:24:41.66,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let’s keep on living our lives\N{\i1}Bokura no jinsei wo tayumazu ni susumi tsuzukeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.66,0:25:02.28,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let’s begin the story of our lives\N{\i1}Bokura no jinsei no monogatari wo saa hajimeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.13,0:22:58.83,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1266,628)}Kodai {\3c&H000000&}Susumu:\NMori Yuki:\NShima Daisuke:\NSanada Shiro:\NNanbu Yasuo:\NAihara Yoshikazu:\N Ohta Kenjiro:\NTokugawa Hikozaemon:\NNiimi Kaoru:\NKato Saburo:\NYamamoto Akira:\NAnalyzer:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.13,0:22:58.83,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1290,148)}Ono Da{\3c&H000000&}isuke\NKuwashima Houko\NSuzumura Kenichi \NOtsuka Hochu\NAkabane Kenji\NKokubun Masato\NChiba Yuki\NMugihito\NHisakawa Aya\NHosoya Yoshimasa \NTanaka Rie\NCho
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:04.68,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1288,632)}{\3c&H000000&} Katsuragi Touko:\NSaito Hajime:\NNagakura Shiori:\NAmagi Toshio:\NKurata Masaru:\NHijikata Ryu:\NKishida Yu: \NYamazaki Susumu: \NHoshina Yuria: \N Kiryu Mikage: \NHoshina Toru:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:04.68,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1306,194)}{\3c&HFF0000&} {\3c&H000000&}Kaida Yuko\NTochi Hiroki\NAmagai Kazusa\NSaito Jiro\N Yoshikai Kiyohito\NIshizuka Unsho \NShimada Hiroshi \N Tsuchida Hiroshi \N Uchida Aya\NNakamura Eriko \N Takagi Motoki
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.68,0:23:09.68,Karaoke Translation op,CAST3,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1260,614)}{\3c&H000000&}Todo Saki:\NKanzaki Megumi:\N Kusakabe Urara: \NA.I.: \N Yamanami Osamu:\N Serizawa Kotetsu:\NKlaus Keyman: \NZorder:\NGailane: \NGenitz: \NAndromeda XO: \NAndromeda Comm Officer:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.68,0:23:09.68,Karaoke Translation op,CAST3,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1304,134)}{\3c&H000000&}Takagaki Ayahi  \NHayashibara Megumi\NKomiya Arisa\N Cho\NEbara Masashi \NGenda Tessho\NKamiya Hiroshi\NTezuka Hideaki\NShibata Hidekatsu\N Umetsu Hideyuki \NIchinose Hiroaki\NFujimura Kento
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.78,0:25:34.18,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.24,0:25:35.36,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.36,0:25:37.58,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,She lost the memories of the last 4 years ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.58,0:25:38.42,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.42,0:25:41.48,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Are you going to raise the dead ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.82,0:25:44.32,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I'll save the Yamato no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.98,0:25:46.74,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Let's end our suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.78,0:25:47.73,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 20
